ProgramEdit_en.IDS_Office_error:
Add operation failed. Possible reasons and solutions:
1. Microsoft Office is not installed on this computer: Please install Microsoft Office applications and try again;
2. Pre-installed Office: Please activate the pre-installed applications and try again;
3. WPS modified the related registry's key: Install Office applications again after uninstalling WPS.

ProgramManager_en.IDS_ITEM_VIDEO_PUBLISH_RESOLUTION_ERROR:
The resolution of n%s×%s is not supported. The resolution requirements are as follows:
1. Width <= 1920; 
2. Height <= 1920; 
3. Width × Height <= 1920×1088.
